      "raw_text": "[6:30PM] #Marina #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement from UBA roundabout towards NNPC filling station. Inward journey Cathedral church down to Nitel intersection is good.\n\nPerfect movement from State House inward McWen bridge and connecting Force Road.\n\nGood movement from Zone 2 underneath bridge towards Flag Staff House connecting McWen bridge inward Victoria Island.\n\nTraffic is looking good from Onikan roundabout by TBS onward Water Board connecting Nitel intersection.\n\nThe entire stretch of Broad Street is good from General Hospital towards Tinubu Square connecting Abibu Oki Street and Martins junction down to Apongbon.\n\nGood movement on the entire stretch of Igbosere road and Catholic mission Street connecting Ganiu Smith Street.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
